 girl Gigi she  loved family traditions family movie  night and game night on vacations were  important to her did you always looked  out for everyone she was very much in  tune with our feelings and wanted the  best for us and the mother of four  called Kobe the MVP of girl dads and  praised him for being a doting father he  always told the girls how beautiful and  smart they are he taught them how to be  brave and how to keep pushing forward  when things get tough you take care of  our chichi  and I got Nani Bibi and Coco we're still  the best team  [Music]  you
 

